@startuml
' ============================================================
' Sequence Diagram - Log Query Flow
' Admin/System → Log Query API → OpenSearch
' (no PostgreSQL — OpenSearch is primary store)
' ============================================================

skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #333333
  ActorBorderColor #333333
  LifeLineBorderColor #333333
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  ParticipantBorderColor #333333
}

title Sequence Diagram: Log Query Flow

actor "Admin / System" as Client
participant "Log Query\nAPI" as API
database "OpenSearch\n(index: log-events)" as OS

== Full-Text Search ==

Client -> API : GET /logs\n?search=error&source=auth&level=error\n&from=2026-07-01&to=2026-07-24\n&page=1&size=20
activate API

API -> API : Validate query parameters
API -> API : Construct OpenSearch bool query\n{ must: [...], filter: [...] }

API -> OS : SEARCH log-events\n{ query: { bool: { must, filter } },\n  sort: [{ timestamp: desc }],\n  from: 0, size: 20 }
activate OS
OS --> API : { hits: [...], total: 150 }
deactivate OS

API --> Client : 200 { logs: [...], total: 150 }
deactivate API

== Query by Trace ID ==

Client -> API : GET /logs/trace/:traceId
activate API

API -> OS : SEARCH log-events\n{ query: { term: { traceId: "abc-123" } } }
activate OS
OS --> API : { hits: [...] }
deactivate OS

API --> Client : 200 { logs: [...] }
deactivate API

== Query Error Logs ==

Client -> API : GET /logs/errors
activate API

API -> OS : SEARCH log-events\n{ query: { bool: { must: [\n  { term: { level: "error" } },\n  { term: { level: "fatal" } }\n] } } }
activate OS
OS --> API : { hits: [...] }
deactivate OS

API --> Client : 200 { errors: [...] }
deactivate API

@enduml
